  clock: 3  # 96b0
  nonce: 96b0  # 96b0
  message: "Fixed in jgstern-agent/fix/tracker-prefix-resolve-refs. Root cause: --remove-before, --remove-duplicate-of, --remove-not-duplicate-of bypassed _resolve_ref(). Now all 6 ID-reference flags (3 add + 3 remove) go through prefix resolution."  # 96b0
